                </div>

                <div class="news-card-body">

                    <div>

                        <div class="news-category">
                            <i class="fas fa-utensils"></i>
                            Food &amp; Drink
                        </div>

                        <h5 class="news-title">
                            Flavors &amp; Feasts: Latest Culinary Trends and Savory Delights
                        </h5>

                        <p class="news-description">
                            Explore the newest culinary trends and indulge in
                            mouth-watering delights with our comprehensive
                            coverage of flavors and feasts...
                        </p>

                    </div>

                    <div class="news-card-footer">

                        <span class="news-author">
                            <i class="fas fa-user"></i>
