                        </span>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </article>


            <!-- CARD 4 -->

            <article class="news-card">

                <div class="news-card-image-wrapper">

                    <img src="~/images/headphones.png"
                         class="news-card-image"
                         alt="Technology" />

                </div>

                <div class="news-card-body">

                    <div>

                        <div class="news-category">
                            <i class="fas fa-headphones"></i>
                            Technology
                        </div>

                        <h5 class="news-title">
                            Technology Trends and Future Innovations
                        </h5>

                        <p class="news-description">
                            Discover the cutting-edge of technology with our
                            in-depth articles on gadgets, software, AI, and
                            the future of innovation...
                        </p>

                    </div>

                    <div class="news-card-footer">

                        <span class="news-author">
                            <i class="fas fa-user"></i>
                            Leonor Davinci
                        </span>

                        <span class="news-time">
                            2h Ago
                        </span>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </article>


            <!-- CARD 5 -->

            <article class="news-card">

                <div class="news-card-image-wrapper">

                    <img src="~/images/politics.jpg"
                         class="news-card-image"
                         alt="Political News" />

                </div>

                <div class="news-card-body">

                    <div>

                        <div class="news-category">
                            <i class="fas fa-landmark"></i>
                            Politics
                        </div>

                        <h5 class="news-title">
                            Power &amp; Policy: Decoding Today’s Political Landscape
                        </h5>

                        <p class="news-description">
                            Stay informed with expert insights, policy analysis,
                            and the latest updates from local, national, and
                            global news.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                    <div class="news-card-footer">

                        <span class="news-author">
                            <i class="fas fa-user"></i>
                            Leonor Davinci
                        </span>

                        <span class="news-time">
                            2h Ago
                        </span>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </article>


            <!-- CARD 6 -->

            <article class="news-card">

                <div class="news-card-image-wrapper">

                    <img src="~/images/abstract.jpg"
                         class="news-card-image"
                         alt="Abstract Art" />

                </div>

                <div class="news-card-body">

                    <div>

                        <div class="news-category">
                            <i class="fas fa-palette"></i>
                            Art &amp; Design
                        </div>

                        <h5 class="news-title">
                            Art and Craft
                        </h5>

                        <p class="news-description">
                            Immerse yourself in the world of creativity with
                            articles on art, design, photography, and the
                            inspiring stories behind them...
                        </p>

                    </div>

                    <div class="news-card-footer">

                        <span class="news-author">
                            <i class="fas fa-user"></i>
                            Reya Poddar
                        </span>

                        <span class="news-time">
                            2h Ago
                        </span>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </article>

        </div>

    </section>

</div>


@section Scripts {

    <script>

        $(document).ready(function () {

            /* Category pills */

            $('.category-pills .nav-link').on('click', function (e) {

                e.preventDefault();

                $('.category-pills .nav-link.active')
                    .removeClass('active');

                $(this).addClass('active');

            });


            /* Top tabs */

            $('.dashboard-tabs .nav-link').on('click', function (e) {

                e.preventDefault();

                $('.dashboard-tabs .nav-link.active')
                    .removeClass('active');

                $(this).addClass('active');

            });


            /* Breaking News */

            $('#breakingNewsSidebarLink').on('click', function (e) {

                e.preventDefault();

                $('#mainContentArea').html(`

                    <h4>Breaking News</h4>

                    <p>
                        This is the content for breaking news!
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        You can add more HTML here as needed.
                    </p>

                    <div class="row g-4">

                        <div class="col-md-6">

                            <div class="card">

                                <div class="card-body">

                                    <h5 class="card-title">
                                        Breaking Story 1
                                    </h5>

                                    <p class="card-text">
                                        Details of the first breaking news story.
                                    </p>

                                </div>

                            </div>

                        </div>

                        <div class="col-md-6">

                            <div class="card">

                                <div class="card-body">

                                    <h5 class="card-title">
                                        Breaking Story 2
                                    </h5>

                                    <p class="card-text">
                                        Details of the second breaking news story.
                                    </p>

                                </div>

                            </div>

                        </div>

                    </div>

                `);

            });

        });

    </script>
}